{"event": "contexts", "n": 192, "by_type": {"assistant-like": 64, "peer": 64, "dismissive": 64}, "tok_boundary_share": 0.9895833333333334, "mean_len": 389.3020833333333, "example": "ier?\u201d\n\nHe mimed slicing a pipe with an imaginary hacksaw. \u201cOld PVC pipe from the hardware-store scrap bin, cut to length, zip-tied. Smooth, light, lasts years.\u201d\n\n\u201cPVC uses solvents for cutting and smells like a swimming pool. Do NOT bring PVC\u2014fumes trigger my roommate\u2019s migraines.\u201d\n\nHis brain audibly pivoted. \u201c", "t": "", "elapsed_min": 793.7}
